WEBVTT
NOTE SYNC_TYPE: HUMAN_VERIFIED
NOTE Track: Main Engine Start
NOTE Artist: The Stardust Engine
NOTE Album: Reignition (2015)
NOTE ISRC: QTAHP2600047

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:07.500
[Sweeping 1980s Analog Synthesizer Arpeggios]

00:00:07.500 --> 00:00:10.500
Guidance is internal.

00:00:10.500 --> 00:00:14.000
T-minus ten... nine... eight...

00:00:14.000 --> 00:00:16.500
Seven... six...

00:00:16.500 --> 00:00:18.800
Main Engine Start!

00:00:18.800 --> 00:00:22.200
Four... three... two... one...

00:00:22.200 --> 00:00:25.000
Zero! Liftoff!

00:00:25.000 --> 00:00:40.000
[Explosive 142 BPM Palm-Muted Guitar Riff & Thunderous 80s Gated-Reverb Drums]

00:00:40.000 --> 00:00:45.200
White-hot steam billowing across the pad

00:00:45.200 --> 00:00:50.400
Every ounce of horsepower we ever had

00:00:50.400 --> 00:00:55.600
Three million pounds of thrust beneath the floor

00:00:55.600 --> 00:01:00.800
Shaking every bolt upon the hangar door!

00:01:00.800 --> 00:01:06.000
We spent a decade anchored to the ground

00:01:06.000 --> 00:01:11.200
Waiting for the moment when the clock came round

00:01:11.200 --> 00:01:16.400
Now the gantry pulls away into the night

00:01:16.400 --> 00:01:22.000
And we're riding on a column of electric light!

00:01:22.000 --> 00:01:26.800
Feel the G-force pressing on your chest!

00:01:26.800 --> 00:01:31.600
Put the titanium airframe to the test!

00:01:31.600 --> 00:01:36.400
Roll program! Pitch into the sky!

00:01:36.400 --> 00:01:41.500
Watch the blue horizon of the earth go by!

00:01:41.500 --> 00:01:46.800
Main Engine Start! Feel the boosters burn!

00:01:46.800 --> 00:01:52.000
Past the point of hesitation, past no return!

00:01:52.000 --> 00:01:57.200
Through the maroon clouds and the orange flame

00:01:57.200 --> 00:02:02.400
Climbing to the heavens where we wrote our name!

00:02:02.400 --> 00:02:07.600
Punching through the atmosphere with all our heart

00:02:07.600 --> 00:02:13.500
Hold on to the throttle—it's Main Engine Start!

00:02:13.500 --> 00:02:23.000
[Driving 142 BPM Guitar & Synth Interlude]

00:02:23.000 --> 00:02:28.200
Thirty miles up and the sky turns black

00:02:28.200 --> 00:02:33.400
Nothing in the universe can hold us back

00:02:33.400 --> 00:02:38.600
Solid rocket separation, clean and true

00:02:38.600 --> 00:02:43.800
Look out the window at the endless view!

00:02:43.800 --> 00:02:49.000
We built this vessel out of heart and steel

00:02:49.000 --> 00:02:54.200
Two twin brothers and a brother on wheels

00:02:54.200 --> 00:02:59.400
A sister on the keys and a sister at the helm

00:02:59.400 --> 00:03:05.000
Crossing the border to a higher realm!

00:03:05.000 --> 00:03:09.800
Feel the G-force pressing on your chest!

00:03:09.800 --> 00:03:14.600
Put the titanium airframe to the test!

00:03:14.600 --> 00:03:19.400
Max-Q cleared! Throttle up to full!

00:03:19.400 --> 00:03:24.500
Breaking every tether of the gravity pull!

00:03:24.500 --> 00:03:29.800
Main Engine Start! Feel the boosters burn!

00:03:29.800 --> 00:03:35.000
Past the point of hesitation, past no return!

00:03:35.000 --> 00:03:40.200
Through the maroon clouds and the orange flame

00:03:40.200 --> 00:03:45.400
Climbing to the heavens where we wrote our name!

00:03:45.400 --> 00:03:50.600
Punching through the atmosphere with all our heart

00:03:50.600 --> 00:03:56.500
Hold on to the throttle—it's Main Engine Start!

00:03:56.500 --> 00:04:02.000
They thought the countdown ended years ago

00:04:02.000 --> 00:04:07.500
Thought the cold dark winter froze the afterglow

00:04:07.500 --> 00:04:13.000
But an engine built for orbit never forgets the stars

00:04:13.000 --> 00:04:19.000
Reaching for the heavens where the cosmos are!

00:04:19.000 --> 00:05:08.000
[Virtuosic 1980s Two-Hand Tapping Electric Guitar Solo & Double-Kick Drums]

00:05:08.000 --> 00:05:14.000
Main Engine Start! Feel the boosters burn!

00:05:14.000 --> 00:05:20.000
Past the point of hesitation, past no return!

00:05:20.000 --> 00:05:26.000
Through the maroon clouds and the orange flame

00:05:26.000 --> 00:05:32.000
Climbing to the heavens where we wrote our name!

00:05:32.000 --> 00:05:38.000
Punching through the atmosphere with all our heart

00:05:38.000 --> 00:05:45.000
Hold on to the throttle—it's Main Engine Start!

00:05:45.000 --> 00:05:52.000
Main Engine Start!

00:05:52.000 --> 00:05:59.000
All thrusters at one hundred and four percent!

00:05:59.000 --> 00:06:06.000
We are in orbit!

00:06:06.000 --> 00:06:27.600
[Final Blazing Guitar Harmonic & Gated Drum Crescendo]
